{"id": "core-prepare-noise", "name": "prepare_noise (default initial noise)", "family": "noise", "subfamily": "core-initial", "plain": "The default starting noise in ComfyUI: plain standard Gaussian made on the CPU from one seed, so a seed gives the same starting noise regardless of GPU. With batch_index it draws and discards earlier batch items so item N can be reproduced alone.", "math": "\u03b5 ~ N(0,I), shape = latent shape, generator = torch.manual_seed(seed), device = cpu.\nWith noise_inds: for i in 0..max(inds): draw one item \u03b5_i of shape [1,...]; keep if i in inds; output reordered by inds.\nNested latents: one shared generator advances through each sub-tensor in order.", "props": {"distribution": "standard normal", "spectrum": "white", "when_applied": "initial", "normalizes_variance": "no; sample statistics left as drawn"}, "evidence": [{"where": "ComfyUI/comfy/sample.py:22", "symbol": "prepare_noise"}, {"where": "ComfyUI/comfy/sample.py:9", "symbol": "prepare_noise_inner"}, {"where": "ComfyUI/comfy_extras/nodes_custom_sampler.py:724", "symbol": "Noise_RandomNoise"}, {"where": "ComfyUI/comfy_extras/nodes_custom_sampler.py:1003", "symbol": "RandomNoise"}, {"where": "FX-FeiHou__ComfyUI-FeiHou-Toolbox/__init__.py:2222", "symbol": "class _RandomSeedNoise"}, {"where": "Stibo__comfyui-nifty-nodes/nodes/sampling.py:15", "symbol": "class NiftyRandomNoise"}, {"where": "OliveiraNickolas__AllmaNodes/nodes/noise.py:28", "symbol": "class AllmaRandomNoise"}, {"where": "ashllay__ComfyUI_MoreComfy/nodes/Sampling.py:15", "symbol": "class MC_RandomNoise"}, {"where": "komikndr__raylight/src/raylight/nodes.py:1616", "symbol": "class Noise_RandomNoise"}, {"where": "Light-x02__ComfyUI-FluxSettingsNode/FluxSettingsNode.py:16", "symbol": "class Noise_RandomNoise"}, {"where": "JYE-HC__DirectorDeck/nodes/DirectorDeck-RayLight/src/directordeck_raylight/nodes.py:1691", "symbol": "class Noise_RandomNoise"}, {"where": "JasonHoku__ComfyUI-Ultimate-Auto-Sampler-Config-Grid-Testing-Su